$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=tm2rvhalt  LOC_AFTER=?

* The halting step of the reverse machine as a Hoare triple: the label pops the empty input stack, the branch is false, the state is reset and the machine halts.  The machine model proves the same one step as ~ revstep0 .

